{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f ABOUT THIS GAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myth Survivors is a fast-paced survival roguelike set in a world where gods walk among mortals and chaos reigns eternal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates of Olympus have shattered. Gods and Goddesses rise. Monsters swarm. You are a lone champion gifted with divine powers \u2014 and your only goal is to survive the onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through waves of mythological foes, harness powers of the gods, and evolve your build with each run. Collect gold to unlock permanent upgrades and empower future heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Become the storm. Wield the wrath of the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \t16 Unique mythological foes\u00a016 elite\u00a0foes 16 Unique bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 4 Starting Characters (12 more which can be unlocked!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \t1 Starting Map/Biome (3 more which can be unlocked!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \t12 Permanent upgrades to be upgraded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 &quot;Survival Mode&quot; is to be unlocked, survive endless waves of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \tSupports keyboard, mouse, and controller.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001130?t=1772111043","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001130/57818757c6ae4f02aae0cb8e542b3ec683ee9921/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772111043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001130/b5d1ca005b5a9985e7f6cb9ee004f12b2bd9d51e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772111043","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001130/b5d1ca005b5a9985e7f6cb9ee004f12b2bd9d51e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772111043","categories":[{"description"